  {
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "body": "@eric-tc-wong Our nightly builds have moved to rocm7.1 and rocm7.0 and we are not currently building new 6.4 nightlies. We still want to fix this issue in the future see https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/167411#issuecomment-3516364126 but considering we will not be publishing new rocm6.4 binaries is it possible for you to move to rocm7.0 for this use case?",
